	(descr "Sipeed Tang Nano 20K module, 54.04 x 22.55 mm, 2 x 20 pins on 2.54, rows 20.32 apart, pad 1 = pin 73 (HSPI_DIN2) at the USB-C end; the HDMI connector overhangs the far end by about 4 mm and the USB-C the near end by 2 mm (data sheet v1.3 p.3-6); only the pins in use and the corners have holes (the rest come out of the header strips); soldered to the board on two 1x20 pin headers, 2.54 mm, no sockets")
